# Copy to signing.local (untracked) and set the name of the self-signed certificate in your
# login keychain that `make app` should sign the bundle with. Creating one: Keychain Access →
# Certificate Assistant → Create a Certificate, type "Code Signing", self-signed.
#
# A stable signature keeps macOS's permission to read the e-Sword X library across rebuilds.
APPLE_SIGNING_IDENTITY = Two-edged Sword Dev
